ng\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </p>\n<p>(Upto 2 decimal places)</p></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"0.23","high":"0.23"},"solution":"<p>0.23 [0.22 - 0.24]</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/a2aa5232c08eca2f76c41ff5502bc63f66ccf48c.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":33,"type":"MCQ","correct":"D","right":2,"wrong":0.66,"qtext":"<p>A function is defined by <img src=\"/media/13a21346be8f3506adb3a1c777be1f34dd4f78b9.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /> Which one of the following statements is true about this function?</p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div> function is decreasing for (–2, –1).</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> function has a minima for x = –1.</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> function has a maxima for x = 2.</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> function is decreasing for (–1, 2).</div>","isCorrect":true}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>(d)</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/4852180632805d4eaeb95dccb915d2f3938d5942.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>","subject":"Technical"}],"questionCount":33,"parsedAt":"2026-11-10T19:39:07.990Z"}